  "solution": {
    "text": "From <math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math> law of thermodynamics,<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3.0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>101.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.013</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math><br />Alternate solution:<br /><math><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">surr</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">surr</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sys</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sys</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> For the isothermal process:<br /><math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> &nbsp; &nbsp; <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sys</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sys</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><math><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">surr.</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ext</mi></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>101.3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1.013</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160; J</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>",
